<title>SINGAPORE: Petron awards Qatar Marine tender to Total - trade.</title>
<headline>Petron awards Qatar Marine tender to Total - trade.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' refiner Petron Corp has awarded a cargo of June-loading Qatar Marine by a purchase tender to French major Total SA, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The cargo was awarded at Dubai quotes +68 cents per barrel, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender closed last Thursday and offers were made until Friday.</p>
<p>Petron was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
